{
  "title": "Neahkahnie Treasure",
  "indexDescription": "First trip to Manzanita with the Bovee's in 1995.",
  "description": "The summer of 1995 was the first trip to Manzanita with the Bovee's.  We stayed at other places on the Oregon coast but this was the first time at Manzanita.  We have been going there ever since. \n\nWe stayed at a house called Neahkahnie Treasure which is near the north end of the beach.\n\nI remember sitting at the dinner table and when we told Doug and Linda that Kathleen was pregnant with Elisabeth.  \n\nWe would trade a parents night out. Kathleen and I would go out and Doug and Linda would watch the kids, then another night we would switch. We often would go to the Blue Sky restaurant in town.  Sometimes we would go to Cannon Beach.",
